WEBVTT

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.330
Persona.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:12.730
Wanna Shadow Extract with us?

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:20.710
Persona?

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:26.190
I feel like I've known that word for a long time.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:28.390
Hmm... Me, too.

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:29.190
What?

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:33.750
Right... That old man with
the long nose in my dream...

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:41.130
U-umm...

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:44.470
Who's gonna do Shadow Extraction on me?

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.510
Unlike that chick, you get it, huh?

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:51.980
Leave her...

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:53.740
Don't worry.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:56.810
It'll be over while she's asleep.

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:00.080
U-um...

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:09.020
Hey, you sure that was the right glass?

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.430
It doesn't always work on everyone.

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:14.230
Oh well, this will be good either way.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:33.620
Kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:35.820
sono ashiwo tomenna
Don't ever stop

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:39.820
taoreru nowa mada hayaize
It's too soon to fall down

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:42.100
Breakin' through
Breakin' through

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.720
uchinukeyo
Pierce through

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:46.090
yamiwo hurihodoki
Free yourself from darkness

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:49.790
tadoritsuku bashowa hitotsusa
There is only one destination

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:54.310
hurueru sora
Quaking sky

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:59.970
kazewa naniwo tsugeru
What is the wind telling me?

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:05.920
Tadashii datoka soujanai toka
Right or wrong

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:09.020
kudaranai ronsouwa
Nonsensical arguments

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:11.730
kieya shinai kedo
Never go away

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:16.200
shinjita kotowo shinjinuku koto
Believe what you believe in

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:19.300
sono sakini bokurawa
At the end of it all

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.670
hikari mitsukeru darou
We will find the light

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:26.760
saa tokihanate ima
Now is the time to release it

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:29.710
kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:32.080
sono ashiwo tomenna
Don't ever stop

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:35.780
taoreru nowa mada hayaize
It's too soon to fall down

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:38.290
Breakin' through
Breakin' through

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:39.840
uchinukeyo
Pierce through

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.120
yamiwo hurihodoki
Free yourself from darkness

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:45.990
tadoritsuku bashowa hitotsusa
There is only one destination

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:00.510
Don't you think those two are taking too long?

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:06.210
Yeah... I'm sure girls have a lot to do
when they go to the bathroom together.

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:09.380
A lot? It's not like they wear make-up or anyth...

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:13.810
What's going on?

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:15.810
It's coming from the bathrooms!

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:22.930
Megumi! Morimoto!

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.730
Hey, guys! What the hell-!?

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:28.090
Takuro, are you okay!?

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:11.840
Hello?

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.680
Eiko-neechan?

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:21.780
You've grown so much, Jun-kun.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:23.360
You really did.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:26.320
I mean, it's been ten years. Of course you would.

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:31.060
It's like seeing both you and Yuki at the same time.

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:43.040
Ryo didn't tell me you two were back, even
though we've seen each other every day...

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:57.530
Oh... You're so different from our Aunt.

00:04:57.530 --> 00:05:00.260
She wasn't too good at cooking...

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:03.560
Now, eat up.

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:05.190
Thank you.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:11.440
It's good.

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:14.740
Thanks. Take your time.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:20.480
Hmm? It tastes familiar to me.

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:22.580
So you remember.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:26.040
Your mom taught me how to cook...

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:28.920
I see...

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:32.250
Sorry. Phone call...

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:37.550
It's niichan.

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:40.360
Hello? Guess what!?

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:43.740
Jun, sorry, but I'm gonna be a bit late tonight.

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:44.270
What?

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:48.940
W-we're having too much fun,
so... I'll call you back later.

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:49.770
Are you at the police station?

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:52.980
How did you know?

00:05:56.220 --> 00:06:01.310
So that "Shadow Extraction"
thing is popular among kids now?

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:10.460
There've been cases of kids playing with
sleeping pills and that voodoo game lately.

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:18.200
It looks like the employee snuck
the drug into the two girls' drinks.

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:20.780
He must've been a common offender.

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:22.740
How dare they!

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:26.340
Kayano Megumi-san is unconscious.

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:31.120
Are... such drugs ineffective on you?

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:32.150
...Yes.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:36.060
You lost consciousness when you felt in danger...

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:36.160
Kayano Megumi: Coma, carried out
Morimoto Kanaru

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:39.290
And woke up when those two guys got there.

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.940
Have a seat.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:48.830
Okay.

00:06:56.940 --> 00:06:58.780
Kanzato Shin 17
Chief's brother. The second oldest of the three.

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:03.750
...Did you see anything?

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:07.420
Anyone running away?

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.420
Oh... No.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.420
I see.

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:19.400
Anyway, please keep this incident to yourselves.

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:19.430
What?
Anyway, please keep this incident to yourselves.

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:19.870
What?

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:23.700
It's the Chief's order.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:34.880
Do you think we're suspects in this whole deal?

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:39.450
How could a human possibly do that, anyway?

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:47.660
What's the matter, Shin?

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:48.800
Nothing...

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:51.430
I'm sorry.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.900
If only I had said no...

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:59.470
You couldn't have refused those
types. This isn't your fault at all.

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:02.470
Please.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:08.650
Um... uhh... Hey.

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:13.180
Why don't we go visit Kayano-san at the hospital?

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:15.690
Guys.

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:20.720
Kayano Megumi-san is well taken care of.

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:23.990
She should regain consciousness
by tomorrow morning.

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:35.900
What were you doing at the scene!?

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:40.010
I've already told everything to the detective...

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:40.970
Come!

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:44.010
Ryo-niichan...

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:48.480
C-can you guys head out without me?

00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:55.390
I'll take you guys home.

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:56.590
But...

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.770
He'll be fine.

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:04.170
Leave this town as soon as possible.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:07.440
I'll find a new place for you guys.

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:09.780
Why?

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:11.570
I don't get it.

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:16.150
I didn't do anything.

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:19.820
Why do you look so angry?

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:27.860
Ito-san. Please report directly to me on this case.

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:34.770
Please turn in all reports, including video
footage, without making any copies.

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:36.570
Also, make sure this doesn't leak...

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:37.940
Please...

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:41.740
Understood.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.910
You got that, Shin?

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:02.990
Niichan!

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:06.830
Shin-niichan! Hey!

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:08.540
Jun...

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:16.810
It's another Reverse incident.

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:21.220
No, nothing to do with the list this time.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:24.690
It was some kid outside of school.

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.750
I'll send the details later.

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:28.020
What's going on with you?

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:29.520
What do you mean?

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:32.790
You seem rather freaked out.

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.920
...I wasn't expecting this.

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:40.200
An anonymous petition was
turned in at headquarters.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:44.640
They're claiming the families of those
investigators diagnosed with a mysterious

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:48.080
mental disorder have the right
to know the incident's details.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:52.380
I'd guess it was Ito, the criminal department head.

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:58.790
Just handle it in an appropriate
manner for the time being.

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:02.120
Sure, but they're not gonna wait too long.

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:06.580
I'll call back soon.

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:15.500
Yes.

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:18.930
Connect me.

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:26.050
How can I help?

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:29.780
Thank you for answering to us, Chief Kanzato.

00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:33.980
I'm someone who has very
useful information for you.

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:37.980
Can we meet once?

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:49.940
Tomorrow night.

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:50.530
Yes.

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:54.680
He might have been waiting to hear from us.

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:58.910
He probably thinks we're related
to that incident from today.

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:03.120
Even if it were that Special A boy...

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:06.650
They would've turned him
away at the interrogation.

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:09.520
It wasn't something a mere human could do.

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:14.800
Unless Kanzato Ryo reveals the
existence of Personas to his underlings...

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:17.800
...No human will be suspected.

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:20.790
I saw the corpse.

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:25.460
It was completely "bare"...

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:29.740
He's probably more useful than Yuji.

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:34.520
He messed up his important task
of catching the Special A Latent...

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:37.020
Why did you make him go, anyway?

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:39.720
It was Kujo-san's decision.

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:42.620
Fanaticism isn't good, Toma.

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:49.760
Anyway, that Special A boy is worth extracting.

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:52.300
Have you been doing okay?

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:57.160
You sure turned into a trendy high schooler.

00:13:00.510 --> 00:13:01.940
Eiko-neecha...

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:08.580
You haven't... changed at all.

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.050
What?

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:12.650
Nothing.

00:13:13.190 --> 00:13:16.590
Oh, but I see something familiar.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:24.260
Jun and Yuki always made fun of you,
even though you're the older brother...

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:30.700
This is how it's supposed to
be after ten years, right?

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:38.780
Ayanagi City General Hospital

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:41.220
Hello? Do you know who I am?

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:42.010
Megumi!

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.820
Oh... You guys came.

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:48.220
Yup. You seem fine.

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:51.210
Yeah, but...

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:57.030
Oh, a detective came earlier
and told me about last night...

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:59.360
Actually, he interrogated me about it...

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:00.730
Um...

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.000
I'm sorry.

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:06.870
You had to go through such a
scary thing, all because of me.

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:09.340
No, I...

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:13.610
Kayano-san, who is-?

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:18.140
Oh, she's my club's senpai.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:22.090
I didn't recognize her...

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:25.580
We had just danced together recently...

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:52.790
You kids aren't under suspicion
regarding what happened yesterday.

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:54.360
Just relax.

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:55.120
Then...

00:14:55.120 --> 00:15:00.560
I wanted to talk to you about
your brother, Chief Kanzato.

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:05.000
I'm going to go against my duty of
protecting privileged information.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:07.000
Please keep what I'm about to say between us.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:11.010
W-wait, I didn't ask for this.

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:15.140
Your brother is hiding something very serious.

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:26.790
I appreciate how you're handling
the press regarding all this.

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:31.590
How were you able to even try and stop our plan?

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:37.800
...I wasn't even aware of your
existence, let alone your plan.

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:41.290
I could say I was expecting it, though.

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:48.310
Our Latency list coincidentally
matched up with yours, is all.

00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:54.210
I see... So we just made our
move slightly faster than you.

00:15:54.210 --> 00:16:00.390
It's coming to a point where I'm forced
to handle this without the police.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:05.120
If you're going to do that, why don't
you try turning your back against them?

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:11.690
Either way, the police can't possibly catch us.

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:28.080
Okazaki Takashi
Tasaka Yumi

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:40.020
I'd like to introduce you to our leader.

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:43.820
If teaming up is your proposition, I'll pass.

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:52.070
The A Latent, Tasaka Yumi, is in that hospital.

00:16:54.510 --> 00:17:01.250
Even if she's just a carrier for the rest of
her life due to an attempted extraction...

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:05.580
We can "peel" her to "kill" her...

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:11.390
And we can then take that
peeled Persona into ourselves.

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:16.190
This is what you wished for.

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:20.590
I don't remember wishing for this.

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:28.040
Who is your leader?

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:30.470
You'll find out if you come with us.

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:32.800
If you still refuse...

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:37.810
You'll just have to assimilate into
our, the Marebito's, Persona.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:27.770
Yuji, get him.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:51.060
Yuji, what's wrong with you!?

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:53.460
I-It's gone.

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:56.860
I don't have it... I can't do it anymore!

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:34.700
Sotaro!?

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:45.510
What?

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:47.750
What is this?

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:40.900
What is this!?

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:42.630
What's going on!?

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:54.580
Your brother is hiding something.

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:59.950
There have been several incidents
similar to what you were caught up in.

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:17.860
Oniichan...

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:26.180
Have you heard about the missing
students from your school?

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:29.080
They no longer exist in this world.

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:31.710
Not even their families know this.

00:21:32.990 --> 00:21:33.220
Your brother has a list of names that
match up with some of those people.

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:36.020
Your brother has a list of names that
match up with some of those people.
Okazaki Takashi
Tasaka Yumi

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:37.320
Your brother has a list of names that
match up with some of those people.

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:39.290
I'd like to get the details.

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:53.240
Omotai kusariwo
The heavy chain

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:59.080
ima hazushite agemashou
I will take it off for you

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:04.450
jiyuuni naretara
Once you're free

00:22:04.450 --> 00:22:10.790
kokowo habataite yukeruwa
You'll be able to fly away

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:17.330
atashiga samatage
I stood in your way

00:22:17.330 --> 00:22:26.140
ubatte kita madaminu sekai e
and took that world you haven't seen

00:22:26.140 --> 00:22:30.840
tamerau nonara
If you're going to hesitate

00:22:30.840 --> 00:22:39.690
huriharatte ageru sono udewo
I will free that arm for you

00:22:39.690 --> 00:22:44.020
soshite tookue
Then to faraway

00:22:44.020 --> 00:22:50.160
dekirudake tookue
As far away as possible

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:53.600
aishiteruno
"I love you"

00:22:53.600 --> 00:22:57.040
ikanaideyo
"Don't leave me"

00:22:57.570 --> 00:23:04.480
koware chaukara
I will break

00:23:13.650 --> 00:23:16.280
The scent of distant day.

00:23:16.760 --> 00:23:19.190
A small room embraced by sunlight.

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:23.190
Silent laughter.

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:28.190
Treasures exist, answering prayers.

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:33.330
Another awakens with the sea's rumbling roar.

00:23:34.310 --> 00:23:36.970
Like clear water...

00:23:37.840 --> 00:23:40.870
Like a bright light.
